        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-A6, Bronze Round Radius Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Round Mount Bronze Towel Bar is available in either medium bronze or dark bronze. It comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. Choose from an 18 inch, 24 inch, or 30 inch size. This traditionally styled towel bar is great for any space. It will add a classic touch that is both timeless and beautiful.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/round-mount-river-rock-towel-ring-fusion-tr-a6\"><b>Fusion TR-A6 Bronze River Rock Towel Ring</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/river-rock-round-mount-toilet-paper-holder-fusion-ph-a6\"><b>Fusion PH-A6 Bronze River Rock Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/bronze-river-rock-rope-hook-with-round-mount-fusion-rh-a6\"><b>Fusion RH-A6 Bronze River Rock Robe Hook</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-A6</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-A6</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-A6</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
